# <type>(<optional-scope>)<optional-!>: <imperative summary>
#
# Examples:
#   feat(lyrics): add word-level timing
#   fix(playback): retain position after source switch
#   docs: explain local build prerequisites
#
# Allowed types: feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci,
# chore, revert
# Subject limit: 72 characters; no trailing period.
# See COMMIT_CONVENTION.md for the full convention.
